        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Ub 22:1-23:30; 2 Kei 34:1-35:27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe pa Yehova m’uwok ba Zefania ma wod Kuci, ma wod Gedalia, ma wod Amaria, ma wod Hezekia, i ceng’ pa Yosia ma wod Amon, m’ubimo mi Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abijigo wi gin ceke pet kud i wang’ ng’om, Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abijigo wi dhanu ku yedi; abijigo wi winyo ma kor polo, ku rec m’i nam, man gin ma redho jo karacelo ku judubo; man abithumo dhanu woko kud i wang’ ng’om, Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abirieyo cinga wi Yuda, man wi dhanu ceke m’ubedo i Yerusalem; man abithumo dong’ dhanu mi Bal woko kud i ka maeni, man nying’ Jukemari ku julam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku ju ma rwo ni udul mi polo wi usimbru udi; man ju ma rwo, ma kwong’o kwong’ ni Yehova man ma kwong’o kwong’ ku Malkam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku ju m’udok cen kum lubo Yehova; ku ju m’uyenyo Yehova ngo, kadi m’upenje de ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bed ling’ i vut Rwoth Yehova; kum ceng’ pa Yehova ni ceng’ni: kum Yehova yiko lam, elonyo welo pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i ceng’ mi lam pa Yehova, nia abisendo judongomawijo, man wot ubimo, man wagi dhanu ceke m’ukendo kendi mi juwirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ceng’ maeca abisendo dhanu ceke ma gipor ku pondot, ma gipong’o ot pa rwodhgi ku rop man abombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ceng’ maeca, Yehova wacu, baywak bibedo nuti i dhugang’ mi rec, man goyonduru i ng’ete mir ang’wende, man bamor ma dit m’uai i ungulu gudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wugoi nduru, wu ju m’ubedo i Maktec; kum dhanu ceke mi Kanan wigi jik; dhanu ceke ma giyeyo ter mi mola ma tar juthumogi woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i nindo maeca, nia abiyenyo i Yerusalem ku thala; man abisendo dhanu ma gigwokri gigi, ma giwacu yor i adundegi kumae, Yehova bitimo ber ungo, kadok rac de ebitimo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E lonyo migi bidoko ni ayeki, man udigi ni uvuru: eyo, gibigomo udi, ento gibibedo i igi ngo; man gibipidho podho mir ulok, ento gibimadhu pige ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceng’ ma dwong’ pa Yehova ni ceng’ni, eni ceng’ni man etimbre pio, en e dwand ceng’ pa Yehova; dhanu ma tek ywak keca ku can. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceng’ maeca en e ceng’ mi kwinyo, en e ceng’ mi can ku mono, ceng’ mi nyoth kud uvuru, ceng’ mi piny ma col man abu, ceng’ mir afuru man piny ma col bii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ceng’ mir a wara ku lemndiri, kum adhura ma tek mang kum gang’ m’utingre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abikelo mono wi dhanu, kara giwoth calu dhanu m’abinga, kum gidubo kum Yehova; man rimbgi jubikonjo woko calu utur, man ring’kumgi calu weyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadok mola ma tar migi kadi mola ma kwar migi bicopo bodhogi ngo i ceng’ mi kwinyo pa Yehova; ento ng’om dho biwang’ ku mac mi ngiri pare: kum ebijigo, eyo, ebijigo ku ndiri, dhanu ceke m’ubedo i ng’om.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
